Generating Warnings During Gate Pulses
Using the
gd_pulsewarn
-xlrm gd_pulsewarn option, VCS generates a warning when it detects that the
width of a pulse is identical to the gate delay. For example, consider the following Verilog
code:
module dut(qout,dinA,dinB);
output qout;
