Support for the Debug Argument in the SystemVerilog
Randomize Methods
The SystemVerilog class object randomize() and std::randomize() methods are
enhanced to support the additional .debug() argument with the following functionality.
In case of constraints failure:
• The randomize( .debug(null) ) function call suppresses the CNST-SATE and CNST-
CIF messages in the simulation output and disables the generation of the extracted
