Support for Multiple Clocking Event Expressions in Sampled
System Function Calls
VCS supports multiple clocking event expressions in sampled system function calls.
The following is the syntax of this feature:
$past(x,,,@(posedge clk1 or negedge clk2))
Following are the examples usage:
