Support for Cover Sequence in Assertions
VCS supports cover sequence in assertions. Cover sequence reports all the matches
for each evaluation attempt. Results of coverage for a sequence includes the number of
times attempted and number of times matched and each attempt can generate multiple
matches.
The following is the syntax of this feature:
cover sequence (@(posedge clk) sequence_name);
Example 249 test.sv
module test ;
bit clk,clk1, a, b,c;
always begin
#15 clk = ~clk;
end
clk = 0 ; a = 1;b= 1;
end
#200;
end
sequence s0;
a ##1 b;
A1 : cover sequence ( @(posedge clk) disable iff (c) s0) $display("A1
