Support for SystemC Designs in Verilog-AMS
In the above example, a connect module insertion is required inside the bot module
because p1 wreal signal is connected to the e1 electrical port of the anaMod module. To
select the connect module, there are two connect rules that refer to two different connect
modules, that is, elect_to_logic and elect_to_wreal respectively.
The elect_to_wreal connect module has digital output port of type wreal with myLogical
discipline. Therefore, the elect_to_wreal connect module is selected as per the connect
module selection algorithm.
