register reg_name=reg_0;
register reg_name=reg_1;

register reg_name=reg_7;
}
The repetitive process could be simplified by using the TCL for-loop command. Using the
for-loop only simplifies the syntactical requirements of the specification. It does not change
the RAL model that will be ultimately generated.
