vmm_ral_sys::get_subsys_by_name()
Returns the subsystem with the specified name in this system.
virtual function vmm_ral_sys get_subsys_by_name(
virtual function vmm_ral_sys get_subsys_by_name(
Finds a subsystem with the specified name in the system and returns its descriptor. If no
system is found, returns null.
Subsystem name uniqueness is guaranteed only within a single system. Therefore, if
used on a system with more than one subsystem having the same name but in different
subsystems, this method returns the first subsystem found.
