vmm_sb_ds_typed::new_sb_iter()
Create a scoreboard iterator.
function vmm_sb_ds_iter new_sb_iter(int exp_stream_id = -1,
function vmm_sb_ds_iter new_sb_iter(integer exp_stream_id = -1,
Creates and returns a scoreboard iterator object that can iterate over all of the currently-
defined streams of expected packets in the scoreboard.
If an expected stream identifier is specified, only the streams (one per input stream, if any)
of expected packets for that expected stream identifier are iterated on.
If an input stream identifier is specified, only the streams (one per expected stream, if any)
of expected packets for that input stream identifier are iterated on.
