Limit FSDB Size
$fsdbAutoSwitchDumpfile
Automatically switch to a new dump file when the working FSDB file reaches the specified
size, the specified wall time period, or the specified simulation time period.
The unit associated with $fsdbAutoSwitchDumpfile's File_Size parameter is a megabyte.
After the dumping is finished, a virtual FSDB file is automatically created and list all of the
generated FSDB files with the correct sequence. Only the virtual FSDB file, rather than all
of the FSDB files, needs to be loaded to view the simulation results.
The unit associated with $fsdbAutoSwitchDumpfile's by_period is second.
The minimum auto-switch period of the FSDB file is 30s. If you specify a time
period number smaller than 30, then the FSDB Dumper prints a warning
message and sets the time period to 30.

The unit associated with $fsdbAutoSwitchDumpfile's by_sim_period is simulation time
units.
When specified in the design to switch based on file size:
$fsdbAutoSwitchDumpfile(File_Size | File_Size_var, "FSDB_Name" |
FSDB_Name_var, Number_of_Files | Number_of_Files_var
[ ,"log_filename" | ,log_filename_var ], ["+no_overwrite"]);

When specified in the design to switch based on time period:
$fsdbAutoSwitchDumpfile(Time_Period_in_seconds |
Time_Period_in_seconds_var, "FSDB_Name" |FSDB_Name_var,
Number_of_Files | Number_of_Files_var[ ,"log_filename" |
,log_filename_var ], ["+no_overwrite"], "+by_period");

When specified in the design to switch based on simulation time period:
$fsdbAutoSwitchDumpfile(SimTime_Period | SimTime_Period_var,
"FSDB_Name" |FSDB_Name_var, Number_of_Files |
Number_of_Files_var[ ,"log_filename" | ,log_filename_var ],
["+no_overwrite"], "+by_sim_period+time_unit");

or
$fsdbAutoSwitchDumpfile(Ignored_Argument, "FSDB_Name" |FSDB_Name_var,
Number_of_Files |
Number_of_Files_var[ ,"log_filename" | ,log_filename_var ],
["+no_overwrite"], "+by_sim_period+simtime_with_unit");

Synopsys (file size):
fsdbAutoSwitchDumpfile File_Size FSDB_name Number_of_Files [log_filename]

Synopsys (time period):
fsdbAutoSwitchDumpfile Time_Period_in_seconds FSDB_name Number_of_Files

